    "title": "Order multiple adverbials",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-adverbials-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Order multiple adverbials",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Time and place usually establish the setting before manner and the action. Scope words apply to the phrase they frame; moving them can change who, where or what is included. The position of 只 changes its scope: before 在学校 it limits the place; immediately before 看书 it limits the activity at that place. The focus of 只 also depends on context: 只看书 may restrict the reading material rather than exclude every other activity.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我们明天在学校一起看书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen míngtiān zài xuéxiào yīqǐ kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "We will read together at school tomorrow.",
                "audio": "9312cf08b72a97e93909cb084fa219de26b350f89b746c23acec2679e040b44c"
              },
              {
                "text": "我们都在学校看书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen dōu zài xuéxiào kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "All of us read at school.",
                "audio": "d8b29ced81e7815f08d8d60752f4a09237d7f1debbf568e11204ab150ee49d1e"
              },
              {
                "text": "我只在学校看书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zhǐ zài xuéxiào kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "School is the only place where I read.",
                "audio": "107f6d5b935313830f998ed52914468939ced1550cdc30a91b1ab3b8325fee6a"
              },
              {
                "text": "我在学校只看书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zài xuéxiào zhǐ kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "At school, I only read books.",
                "audio": "9cb6138870f1ee58567cfb08c1c7b1e4e8b58ae8a9d3f6dc8ab4c026bdd6c6dc"
              }
            ]
